WEBVTT

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:14.110
Oath recital by Hasekura Kouhei-kun from Class 5-3,
lead organizer of this year's Sports Festival.

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:11.570
Festival

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.570
Sports

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:12.200
Shuuchikan Academy

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.040
Um...

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.000
So...

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:26.000
Ah...

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.590
What were the words?

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.760
You go, Mr. Women's Bath!

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:40.470
Darn it!

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:44.020
Oath!

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:47.600
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:47.600
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.810
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibiku wa

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.810
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:55.070
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:55.070
I want to tell you, but I can't.

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:59.070
Hatenai omoi ha anata...

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:59.070
I always long for you...

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:09.500
Boukansha no hibi ni yuuki wo dashitara sayonara

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:09.500
Say goodbye to the days of just being a bystander.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:18.550
Demo "jiyuu" no teigi ni buranko no you ni yureteru no ne?

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:18.550
But am I swaying over the meaning of "Freedom", like a swing?

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:23.680
Gosenfu ni kaita kaidan

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:23.680
Stairs drawn on a music score,

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:27.180
Ippo susunde niho sagattemo

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:27.180
Even if I go down one step and back two steps,

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:31.190
Honno chotto setsunasa utau

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:31.190
The notes play a sad melody.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:34.230
Watashi no real kanjite ne

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:34.230
Hear my reality!

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:38.150
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:38.150
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:41.700
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibikuwa

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:41.700
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:45.660
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:45.660
I want to tell you, but can't

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:49.080
Zutto anata wo sagashiteta

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:49.080
I've always been searching for you.

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.170
Tatoeba sou anataga hikari

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.170
Let's say you are the light

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:56.630
Watashi ga kagede mitsume aetanara

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:56.630
And I'm the shadow, gazing at one other.

00:01:56.630 --> 00:02:00.670
Namida iro no diamond

00:01:56.630 --> 00:02:00.670
The tear-colored diamond

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:04.470
Nee zero kara kagayakasetai

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:04.470
I want to make it shine from nothing.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:10.020
Kowagaranaide musunde ne ai wo

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:10.020
Don't be afraid of falling in love.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:12.190
Deaiwo...

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:12.190
Nor of meeting people...

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:18.320
Sports

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:18.320
Festival

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:18.320
Key

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:21.660
They're really going at it.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:25.450
Shuchikan Academy's Sports Festival has started!

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:30.080
On the field, a fierce battle is already underway.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:28.120
Headquarters

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:32.080
All together now!

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:34.090
Congratulations.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:38.590
Girls' 100m run, Class 1 takes it away!

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:45.350
Shuuchikan Academy

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.350
You were pretty close.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:49.640
No big deal.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.440
I wasn't serious.

00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:00.360
She passes in other courses right at the borderline,

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:05.330
but I feel Kuze-san does it on purpose.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:20.840
Sports

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:20.840
Festival

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:29.640
Next up is the girls' 400m run!

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:33.440
The commentator will be Hasekura Kouhei-kun!

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.310
What?

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:35.110
Me?!

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:40.360
The girl doing the commentary asked me to sub in for a while.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.900
Then you should do it.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.860
That's fine, but...

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:48.240
It has begun!

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:51.040
My bride, Hina-chan, is in second place right now!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.250
She's the cute girl running on the left side.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.960
Actually, she'd be on the right side of the course.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.130
Oh, whatever.

00:03:56.130 --> 00:04:00.300
Hina-chan! Go!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.300
Your comments are too biased!

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:05.050
See? When I do it, it becomes all about Hina-chan.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:08.600
That's why I'm asking you to make it fair.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.850
Yeah, okay...

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.690
Wait, Kanade-san, you have the mic on transmit.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:13.730
Oops.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:15.560
In that case, it's time to sing a song.

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:16.860
No, it's not!

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.860
What are they doing...

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:20.530
She's my bride.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.950
Love! Love! Love! Hina-chan love!

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.030
Please excuse that.

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.870
Girls' 400m run. The leader is...

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.790
...Sendo Erika from Class 2.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:32.870
The gap between her and the next competitor, Yuki Haruna from Class 3, is...

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:34.000
...three horse lengths!

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.880
Sei-chan. He said horse lengths.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:39.880
Sendo makes her move!

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.880
She's fast.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:44.470
With a separation of four horse lengths,

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.890
she finishes first!

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.800
Goal!

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:47.390
Good work.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:53.560
Am I a racehorse or something?!

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:00.480
That concludes Kouhei Theater.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.360
Good going, lead organizer!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.370
Sister. This. Can I borrow yours?

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.370
Fry
pan

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:19.630
Go for it!

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.380
Stop it.

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:32.390
Pull! Pull! Pull!

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:45.570
End of line

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:48.410
The red-hot booth

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:47.200
It is now lunchtime.

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:54.540
Kouhei-kun.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:58.540
If you'd like...

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.090
This.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.170
It looks very nice.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:10.180
Did you make all of this, Haruna?

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:12.140
Yes...

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.680
Amazing, isn't it?

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:16.230
Hina-chan got up early to make this.

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:19.230
I may have made too much.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.730
So everyone, help yourselves.

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:24.730
Okay.

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.110
Itadakimasu.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:31.120
It's good.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.700
The seasoning is perfect.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:37.000
You're a really good cook, Haruna-senpai.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.870
Oh please...

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:42.460
But I'm glad it suits everyone's taste.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:48.880
Um, if it's not a burden, please have mine, too.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:54.010
Lunch packed by your sister, huh?

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:55.430
I'm so jealous.

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:02.350
Fried noodles?

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:03.900
Without ginger, too.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:08.400
I-It's... because Kouhei-kun always has it at lunch.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:13.200
You playboy, you.

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:14.910
Thank you.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.920
So Hasekura-kun likes fried noodles.

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:28.840
Kouhei, you're running the three-legged race with Hina-chan, right?

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:32.340
Tying the knot with Hina-chan, eh? You lucky dog.

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:34.930
You two are tying the knot?

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:38.850
Kanade-san. Please don't say such misleading things.

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:42.730
However, Kouhei! Hina-chan is my bride!

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:46.860
If you want her, you must defeat me first!

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.230
She's not listening at all.

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:53.110
They really get along, don't they?

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:57.120
You three came up with the new event, the water balloon toss, together, right?

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:01.000
There are many people looking forward to it.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.630
It was Kouhei's idea originally.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:08.130
Yup. He said there should be an event that everyone can enjoy together.

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.630
It was a spur of the moment idea.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:16.140
It came together thanks to these two listening to my idea.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:17.640
Okay!

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:22.140
To make the most out of the new event, I'm going to enjoy the day to the fullest!

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:22.140
Yeah!

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:27.610
But Hasekura-senpai, you'll be sitting at the main tent during the event, won't you?

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:35.160
Oh. So you can't participate in the event you came up with...

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:39.660
I'll be happy if you all enjoy enough for me, though.

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:41.660
How admirable.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:43.330
Kuze-san?

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:47.170
Or are you indulging in your own sacrifice?

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:49.500
Kuze-san! You don't have to put it like that!

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:53.220
It's fine. She's right; I was showing off a little much.

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:02.180
Good grief.

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:05.810
Does she fit in at all in class?

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:07.310
More or less.

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:10.730
She's still skipping class, right?

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.820
Hello, it's been a while.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.040
Are you bored?

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:32.050
I don't have too much time right now.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.630
It's taken quite a liking to you.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.550
The afternoon events are starting.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:40.300
Don't you need to come back?

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:44.390
Are you talking to me as the lead organizer?

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.940
No, just as a classmate.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.310
Hi there.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:56.280
All the events I am signed up for are over,
so it is not a problem for me to be here, is it?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.070
I don't really get it.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:06.080
I would have thought that you wouldn't take part in the Sports Festival at all, but here you are.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:11.540
And you look bored, sitting apart from our classmates.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:17.220
I'm not skipping class based on how entertaining it is.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.350
Are you waiting for someone?

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:30.480
Hey-

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:33.150
Class 5-3, Hasekura Kouhei-kun.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:35.860
Please come to the main tent immediately.

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:39.030
They're calling for you.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:39.780
Yeah.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:49.830
Kuze-san. Since this is a festival,
I think it's better to have as much fun as possible.

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:59.170
It's amazing that someone can be that meddlesome.

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:13.610
It has begun!

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:16.980
The new and most interesting event starting this year! This afternoon!

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:18.360
It's the water balloon toss!

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:23.780
The concept is the same as the ball toss, but the basket is carried by the opposing team and they run around.

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:30.410
The key to the game is teamwork between the supply team filling water balloons, and the attack team throwing balloons.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:33.630
Headquarters

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:36.500
I'm sorry. Because of me, the prizes are...

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:35.130
Gift Storage

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.550
No, it's my mistake.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:41.130
I gave out prizes without checking.

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:43.390
By the time I noticed the situation, it was too late.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:47.140
But we can't ask for them back now...

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:52.140
What do we do? There's not enough time to go buy more now.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:00.490
We want to give them, but don't have them.

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:03.360
Kouhei, this isn't enough.

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:09.160
I wanted to give Hina-chan what she wanted for her birthday.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.580
What should we do, Kouhei?

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:15.710
Waiting for my next allowance would be too late...

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:26.180
Kouhei-kun! Onee-chan! Thank you!

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:37.110
Coupon for anything you want

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:39.190
I know!

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:40.780
Let's make vouchers.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.030
Vouchers?

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:49.080
Yeah. We give vouchers today,
and we'll give the actual prizes another day.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.080
I suppose that works.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.080
Then it's settled.

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:58.210
You three split up and make the vouchers.

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:04.220
I'll go talk to the people from the shopping district and ask them for more prizes.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:06.220
Boss, we'll go with you!

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:11.600
Thanks!

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.350
I'm the wrong target to go after!

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:21.320
No one has ever put a balloon inside my basket!

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:23.860
Of course, since it's a new event.

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:27.360
Sports

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:27.360
Festival

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:27.990
More prizes, huh?

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:29.450
Please!

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:34.370
Raise your head, lead organizer.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.710
We're enjoying the day.

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:42.920
Leave it to us!

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:58.190
Please don't throw at me.

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:09.820
Nii-sama?

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:11.370
Are you all right, Shiro?

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.750
What lovely sibling love!

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:17.160
For your reference, they are on opposing teams.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.670
Kanade! Your shirt's becoming see-through!

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:23.340
No problem.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:25.170
I have a swimsuit.

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:29.050
RA's swimsuit under her wet t-shirt...

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.680
I-It's so hot...

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.220
Yeah...

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:40.690
You bad boys get the discipline sticker!

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.690
You did it, Boss.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:47.690
Yeah.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:05.460
Haruna, go!

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:05.960
Yeah.

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:13.180
Time's up!

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.060
That was tough.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:23.190
Participants of the final event, the three-legged obstacle race, please come to the start line.

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:25.940
I'm sorry, Kouhei-kun.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:31.700
No, I'm glad it's not serious.

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:38.450
Yeah, but what a shame. I was looking forward to running with you.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:40.080
Haruna.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:43.210
Who's going to take Haruna's place?

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:45.590
I can't. I don't think I can do it at all.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.630
I don't think I can either.

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:58.100
I'm not skipping class based on how entertaining it is.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:04.350
Kuze-san.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.400
Could you participate in the three-legged race?

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:09.820
Why me?

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:13.570
I ask that you do, too.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.920
Haruna. Are you all right?

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.710
You shouldn't worry about it, Haruna.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:34.720
This sounds irresponsible, but I think you're unbeatable if you give your best.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:39.220
She's right. If it's Kuze-san...

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.350
Kuze-san.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.280
I won't be responsible for the outcome.

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:03.540
I'm jealous of how silky your hair is.

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:05.960
You think so?

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:06.880
Yeah.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:12.760
I've wanted to chat with you like this.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:17.970
I think we can be good friends.

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:22.180
You're still not done with my hair?

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:31.190
Like it or not, this is the final event.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:34.030
It's the three-legged obstacle course race.

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:35.950
President, what's of most interest in this match?

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.110
Without a doubt,

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:40.910
my beloved little sister.

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:43.450
There he goes with his nonsense again.

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.670
The current leader is Class 2.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:51.710
Class 3 following right behind them.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:54.210
The overall winner will be decided by this event.

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:56.720
The crowd goes wild with cheers, too.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:59.300
Kouhei-kun! Kuze-san!

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:00.550
Go!

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:03.390
Fight! Kouhei!

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:08.520
Hasekura-senpai! Erika-senpai! Good luck to both of you!

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:14.940
The lead organizer's putting up a good fight!

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.360
Go for it!

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:20.370
Do your best!

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.990
Boss!

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:26.870
Kuze-san. I kind of seriously want to win.

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:30.630
Who said it was best to make the most of it and have as much fun as possible?

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.500
Because it's fun, I want to win.

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:40.430
Only half a lap remains.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:42.970
The three-legged race ends here.

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:46.140
Girls will change into their costumes in the dress rooms and...

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:50.600
Look at this! The first one out is...

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:56.150
C-Cat-ears!

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:57.780
It's a cat-eared maid!

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:00.490
Kuze Kiriha from Class 3 is here to serve us!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:04.490
Kuze-san... undid the braids...

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:06.580
Kuze-san's so cute!

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:09.000
Serve me, too!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:11.620
Say meow! Just once is enough!

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:15.500
This is looking good.

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:19.010
Yes?

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:27.680
What has happened to Sendo from Class 2, who entered first?

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:31.690
Looks like Erika got the jackpot.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.190
This has got to be my brother's doing!

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:38.440
It's Nuppio!

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:40.110
Nuppio makes an appearance!

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:42.860
Oh my god~! It's so cute!

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:44.120
That's good in its own way!

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:46.620
Hey...

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:49.830
This... has horrible balance...

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.380
Let's go, Kuze-san.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:05.760
We're going to win this!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:25.120
That concludes all the events for this year's Shuchikan Academy Sports Festival.

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:29.790
It's nice to be young.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:32.750
Yeah. I look forward to next year, too.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.040
Good job, Kouhei.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:38.040
You came in first! You're amazing!

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:40.460
No, it wasn't me.

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.800
Hey, where's Kuze-san?

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:46.050
Yeah, I don't see her around.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:51.310
Good job, lead organizer.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:59.570
Thank you for heckling me during the oath.

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:01.820
No problem. Just a little surprise for you.

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.820
You've done a good job leading everyone as the lead organizer.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:09.620
I've got to give you a reward for working so hard.

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.700
That's fine, you don't have to.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:16.670
A key?

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:18.710
Yes.

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:23.470
To my room.

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:26.970
Of course it's not.

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.430
It's a key to the Governing Students Room.

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:31.470
It's inconvenient not to have one, right?

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:34.480
It's for you, so hold on to it.

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:46.200
Boss!

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:48.280
We finished cleaning up!

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:50.200
All that remains is the after party!

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:53.200
It can't start without the lead.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:55.210
Guys...

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:00.920
He's so popular.

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:02.460
It's due to his good virtues.

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.960
Enjoy, Hasekura-kun.

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:06.720
Hey, Vice Prez!

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:10.220
Things like this aren't so bad.

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:16.560
So you know, this is only a small part of what we do!

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:27.400
I miss you

00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:47.590
Mabushii kurai e ni kaita jikan nano

00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:47.590
Just like in a perfect painting,

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:52.350
Sou ima ha...

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:52.350
Now is a dazzling moment.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:06.400
Kawari hajimeta machinami ni me wo sorashi

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:06.400
I look away from the city that's starting to change

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:12.120
Omoide ha tada iuno

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:12.120
And my memories whisper to me, saying,

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:19.250
Soko de tomadou dake

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:19.250
You're only at a loss.

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:21.250
I miss you

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:25.500
Omoi wo sono mama dakishimete

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:25.500
Hold on to your feelings.

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:27.420
I miss you

00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:31.760
Kawaranu omoi wo shiritai no

00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:31.760
I want to know how you've always felt.

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:33.640
I miss you

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:37.390
Negatteru kara

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:37.390
I'll always long for you, so...

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:43.400
I miss you...

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:21.020
Sixth Episode

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:21.020
「Letter」

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:09.750
The letter read over and over.

00:24:09.750 --> 00:24:13.080
The feeling that's left behind.

00:24:13.100 --> 00:24:19.840
Without a string to tug memories from the heart, summer's just around the corner.
